{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12688","headline":"喻旧部曲 · 元结","name":"喻旧部曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漫游樊水阴，忽见旧部曲。\n尚言军中好，犹望有所属。\n故令争者心，至死终不足。\n与之一桮酒，喻使烧戎服。\n兵兴向十年，所见堪叹哭。\n相逢是遗人，当合识荣辱。\n劝汝学全生，随我畲退谷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}